@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000/api
@token = PEGA_AQUI_TU_TOKEN_DE_ACCESO

### SERVICE-AUTHORIZATIONS - solicitudes HTTP
# Reemplaza el token y ajusta los cuerpos JSON al modelo de la entidad.

### GET /service-authorizations
GET {{baseUrl}}/service-authorizations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

###

### GET /service-authorizations/1
GET {{baseUrl}}/service-authorizations/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

###

### POST /service-authorizations
POST {{baseUrl}}/service-authorizations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "diagnosticId": 1,
  "state": "PENDING",
  "authorizedAmount": "80000.00",
  "channel": "WHATSAPP",
  "respondedAt": null,
  "notes": "Autorización pendiente de confirmación del cliente",
  "recordedBy": 1
}

###
